  'tutorial.home.title': 'The Home button', 'tutorial.home.text': 'The Home button at the start of the menu bar (or Ctrl+Shift+H) brings you back to this start page at any time; your open plans stay in their tabs. The side panels sit right under the toolbar, with the document tabs in the middle between them.',
  'action.criticalPath': 'Find critical path', 'status.critical': 'Critical {count}', 'status.criticalTip': 'Critical path is on. Click to turn it off.', 'notice.criticalPath': 'Critical path: {count} tasks · {chains} chain(s) ({from} → … → {to}) · finishes {finish}', 'notice.criticalNone': 'No critical path (every task has slack).', 'notice.criticalOff': 'Critical path highlighting is off.',
  'tutorial.criticalPath.title': 'Find critical path (toggle)', 'tutorial.criticalPath.text': 'The Find critical path toolbar button (Ctrl+Shift+P, also in the Project menu) calculates the schedule front to back (earliest dates) and back to front (latest dates), finds the tasks without slack and shows the critical path from start to finish. Critical tasks and links turn red, the rest fades, and the status bar gives the count and the chain. Press it again to turn it off.',
  'action.tutorialDoc': 'Tutorial document', 'tip.tutorialDoc': 'Read the tutorial document inside the program (every step with its screen)', 'reader.chapters': 'Go to chapter', 'reader.language': 'Document language', 'reader.startTutorial': 'Start tutorial', 'reader.external': 'Open in browser', 'reader.externalTip': 'Open this document in your web browser',
  'tutorial.tutorialDoc.title': 'Reading the tutorial document', 'tutorial.tutorialDoc.text': 'A document with every step of this tutorial and its screen can be read inside the program: open it from Help › Tutorial document on the home screen or in the Help menu. The bar on top jumps to a chapter, switches 한국어/English, starts the tutorial or opens the document in a browser. Home takes you back.',
